{
  "evt.story_opening.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "九月的校门口人潮涌动。",
      "奶娃拖着行李箱，站在了大学的第一块地砖上。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.story_opening.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "告示牌上写着：",
      "大学四年，每学期两天，每天三件事。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.story_opening.body.3": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "操作提示：WASD 移动，E 互动。",
      "Tab 查看状态，Esc 打开菜单。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.story_opening.body.4": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "今天的目标只有一个：",
      "去任意地点，做一件想做的事。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.story_opening.body.5": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "深呼吸。",
      "大学生活，开始了！"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_1_club_fair.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "开学第二周的广场比平时热闹得多。",
      "各家社团的招牌挤在一起，喊声此起彼伏。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_1_club_fair.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_chenlang",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_chenlang_happy",
    "lines": [
      "新同学！来得正好！",
      "这三个摊位最适合你，我都提前踩好点了！"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_1_club_fair.body.3": {
    "speaker": "npc_sumo",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_sumo_neutral",
    "lines": [
      "实验室今天开放参观。",
      "如果你愿意……可以一起去看看。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_1_club_fair.body.4": {
    "speaker": "npc_xiaoyou",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_xiaoyou_surprised",
    "lines": [
      "游戏同好会的展台在那边。",
      "听说今天有挑战连续纪录的活动……"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_2_first_exam.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "第一次大学期末来了。",
      "复习室里的空气，比平时紧张三成。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_2_first_exam.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_sumo",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_sumo_neutral",
    "lines": [
      "要不要一起过一遍重点？",
      "当然，按你自己的节奏来也行。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_3_art_contest.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "创作征集的海报贴满了公告板。",
      "截稿日期就印在最下面一行。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_3_art_contest.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_xiaoyou",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_xiaoyou_sad",
    "lines": [
      "我想投稿，又有点怕……",
      "奶娃，你会参加吗？"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_4_sports_meet.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "报名表贴在公告板上，长跑一栏还空着。",
      "班里同学的目光，齐刷刷看向这边。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_4_sports_meet.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_chenlang",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_chenlang_happy",
    "lines": [
      "咱们班就差一位长跑选手了！",
      "你腿长，肯定行！"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_5_club_election.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "换届名单下周就要交了。",
      "公告板前围满了讨论的同学。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_5_club_election.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_chenlang",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_chenlang_happy",
    "lines": [
      "换届名单下周就要交了。",
      "我觉得你可以试试。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_6_lab_invite.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "专业课老师课后叫住了奶娃：",
      "“课题组还缺一名本科生，有兴趣吗？”"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_6_lab_invite.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_sumo",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_sumo_happy",
    "lines": [
      "我也在那个课题组。",
      "如果你来，我们可以搭伙做实验。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_7_final_project.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "大四上学期，毕业设计选题表发下来了。",
      "这一次，要选一件真正代表自己的事。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_7_final_project.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_xiaoyou",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_xiaoyou_surprised",
    "lines": [
      "游戏创作马拉松的报名开了！",
      "组、组队的话……我第一个选你！"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_8_graduation_eve.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "离校前的最后一周。",
      "行李箱重新出现，这次是用来装回忆的。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_8_graduation_eve.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "想把最后的时间留给什么？",
      "这个问题在心里转了很多圈。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_1.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "图书馆里，符闹吃的笔突然没水了。",
      "她捏着笔杆，愣了两秒。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_1.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "奶娃默默递过去一支。",
      "符闹吃小声道谢，耳尖有点红。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_1.body.3": {
    "speaker": "npc_sumo",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_sumo_happy",
    "lines": [
      "……谢谢你。",
      "下次，我请你喝图书馆的咖啡。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_2.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "期末临近，奶娃的错题本摊在桌上。",
      "符闹吃主动坐到了对面。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_2.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "两个人把错题按类型分好，",
      "一道一道重新演算。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_2.body.3": {
    "speaker": "npc_sumo",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_sumo_neutral",
    "lines": [
      "你的思路其实很有意思。",
      "只是太跳跃了，要稳一点。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_2.body.4": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "合上错题本时，天已经黑了。",
      "但两个人都觉得，今晚值了。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_3.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "黄昏的图书馆只剩窗边一盏灯。",
      "符闹吃难得地没有做题。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_3.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_sumo",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_sumo_happy",
    "lines": [
      "我想读研。",
      "这里的一切，我还想再看四年。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_3.body.3": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "奶娃没有说话，只是点了点头。",
      "有些梦想，不需要形容词。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_1.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "招新海报缺人手贴。",
      "李振兴抱着一卷海报跑过广场。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_1.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "奶娃接过一半。",
      "两个人跑遍了三栋教学楼。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_1.body.3": {
    "speaker": "npc_chenlang",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_chenlang_happy",
    "lines": [
      "够意思！",
      "明天的招新，全靠咱们了！"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_2.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "活动前夜，场地突然被占。",
      "李振兴第一次露出慌张的神色。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_2.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "奶娃提议去旧礼堂试试。",
      "两个人磨了半个小时，借到了钥匙。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_2.body.3": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "深夜的旧礼堂，桌椅一张张摆好。",
      "李振兴长长地出了一口气。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_2.body.4": {
    "speaker": "npc_chenlang",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_chenlang_happy",
    "lines": [
      "幸好有你。",
      "这种事，我可一个人干不来。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_3.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "毕业季临近，社团要换负责人了。",
      "李振兴把一串钥匙放在奶娃面前。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_3.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_chenlang",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_chenlang_neutral",
    "lines": [
      "活动室、储物柜、荣誉柜。",
      "这串钥匙，我交给你了。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_3.body.3": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "钥匙比想象中沉。",
      "那是一整届活动的心血。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_1.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "食堂角落，小柚边吃边画。",
      "速写本上是整个食堂的热闹。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_1.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "奶娃多看了一眼。",
      "小柚慌忙合上本子，又慢慢打开。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_1.body.3": {
    "speaker": "npc_xiaoyou",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_xiaoyou_surprised",
    "lines": [
      "这、这张还没画完……",
      "不过，你可以看。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_2.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "一款很难的游戏，卡了两个星期。",
      "小柚发来消息：要不……组队？"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_2.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "两个人轮流上阵，",
      "凌晨两点，终于通关。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_2.body.3": {
    "speaker": "npc_xiaoyou",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_xiaoyou_surprised",
    "lines": [
      "通关了！",
      "……和你一起，好像没那么难。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_3.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "系里的合作画布创作开放了。",
      "小柚犹豫了很久，开口邀请奶娃。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_3.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "一个人的线条，另一个人的颜色。",
      "画布上慢慢长出一幅完整的画。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_3.body.3": {
    "speaker": "npc_xiaoyou",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_xiaoyou_happy",
    "lines": [
      "原来合作是这个感觉。",
      "像有人陪着一起做梦。"
    ]
  }
}
